<section>
  <grid spacing="none">
    <grid-item colspan="19" padding="0">
      <ai-image prompt="Quiet editorial hospitality photograph in a boutique hotel library lounge, partial figure seated near a window with hands resting beside a journal, tea glass and folded towel, natural morning light, crisp white surfaces, sea-glass accents and deep teal shadows, observed rather than posed, no text or logos" image-style="restorative-hospitality-editorial" aspect-ratio="portrait" fill="true"/>
    </grid-item>
    <grid-item colspan="41" vertical-align="center">
      <h2>The 60-minute guest ritual</h2>
      <p><b>A consistent spine gives the program operational discipline; the setting and practice give each property its character.</b></p>
      <grid direction="vertical" divider="sm palette-5" marker="number" marker-position="inline" marker-numbering-format="decimal-leading-zero" marker-style="subtle" marker-shape="circle" style="--marker-inline-size:30pt; --marker-gap:12pt" vertical-sizing="hug">
        <grid-item padding="7pt 0">
          <h4>0–5 min · Welcome</h4>
          <p font-size="sm">Personal greeting, orientation, and a simple choice of pace or position.</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item padding="7pt 0">
          <h4>5–15 min · Arrive</h4>
          <p font-size="sm">Accessible breath, mobility, or sensory grounding, led within the practitioner’s qualifications.</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item padding="7pt 0">
          <h4>15–40 min · Restore</h4>
          <p font-size="sm">Guided stretching, sound, quiet movement, or seated relaxation.</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item padding="7pt 0">
          <h4>40–55 min · Linger</h4>
          <p font-size="sm">Tea, water, journaling, or a silent pause connected to the property and time of day.</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item padding="7pt 0">
          <h4>55–60 min · Close</h4>
          <p font-size="sm">A clear ending, optional self-guided takeaway, and warm return to the stay.</p>
        </grid-item>
      </grid>
    </grid-item>
  </grid>
</section>